WEBVTT

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.210
Welcome to the show, everyone!

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:02.220
Let's start the journey
to the Magical World!

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.520
Macmur. Micmur.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:50.860
Mactoral!

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:53.860
Shiny

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.490
Arc!

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.540
Don't forget.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:12.750
It's your belief in yourself
that makes up your magic.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:23.850
LITTLE WITCH ACADEMIA

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:29.810
<i>Thus, our academy is located on ley lines,</i>

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:33.320
<i>which were advocated by Alfred Watkins.</i>

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.530
<i>These ley lines act as a</i>
<i>pipeline for our magical power.</i>

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:39.150
<i>They carry the power to</i>
<i>the tower of Luna Nova,</i>

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:43.580
and it's stored in the Sorcerer's Stone.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.700
The power stored in the Sorcerer's Stone--

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.540
So, the power

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:58.760
can be utilized as a
source for our own power.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.380
Akko!

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.980
"Those who use the
magic only for themselves

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.190
will be destroyed by magic."

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.060
Can anyone tell me who said this?

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.360
Miss Cavendish.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:20.700
T.S. Daniels.
<i>Wizardly Eudemonics.</i>

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:26.580
Good. In order to properly use magic,
it is important to know its history.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:28.910
Understand, Miss Kagari?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.130
That stings!

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:38.380
You just have to bear it.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.300
I'm almost done.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.380
Will this really work?

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:46.680
It will work. Have a little faith
in my special magic potion.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.770
What?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.310
What's this?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.360
You look more like a real witch now.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:58.440
You! You used me as a guinea pig again!

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:03.450
Don't worry. It should go back to normal
in one hour, I think.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.910
Calm down.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.330
It's your fault for falling asleep
to begin with.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.120
Who can stay awake in that boring class?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.450
You think it's boring?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.960
I think the history of magic
is quite interesting.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.710
I don't care about ancient times.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:21.210
I didn't come here to become
a smelly old witch!

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.630
I want to be a cool witch
like Shiny Chariot!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.600
Did you say Shiny Chariot?

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.180
I haven't heard that name in a long time.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.100
Diana?

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:36.480
Do you know about Chariot?
Isn't she so cool?

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:39.110
Goodness gracious.
You're so pathetic.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.860
You entered our academy

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:43.610
after being inspired
by such a vulgar show?

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.450
What did you say?

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.700
No one in the wizard world
would think of it favorably.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.870
If you like that kind of kid's show...

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.870
You should go to wizard kindergarten.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:59.040
There will be a lot of children
of your level.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:04.130
I'll wipe that stuck-up look
off your face!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.840
You should worry about your own face.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:09.600
Take care of yourself.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.060
Good day.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:23.650
Listen, this will be your first flight
at this school.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.530
Today, it will just be a warm-up,
so don't go too crazy.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.620
Every year, there's an idiot
who likes to show off.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.870
-If you do that, I will take points off!
-We finally get to ride a broom at school.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.160
I've been waiting for this for so long.
I'm so excited!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.920
I'll go first, okay?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.180
Good. Next!

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.180
Wait at the lookout tower.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.640
Go ahead. It's your turn.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.730
Hurry up!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.990
Go up, up, up!

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.280
Don' go up! Don' go up!

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:14.830
Stop!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.250
Akko!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.130
What is she doing?

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.170
This stupid broom!

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:29.130
Listen to what I am telling you!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:31.260
What?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.320
Akko!

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.860
Are you all right?

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:49.860
How pathetic.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.530
It hurts.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.910
That was quite a fall.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.160
I'm gonna die.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.750
-Medicine?
-No, thanks!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.170
I didn't know it was your first time
on a broom.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.960
You sure made a fool of yourself.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.630
Thanks a lot!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:08.260
We've been riding on brooms
since childhood.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.680
But you don't come from a witch family.
It's not your fault.

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:14.010
You should have said
that you didn't know how to ride.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.430
It's because...

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:19.890
If I can't do it easily,
I'll never be like Chariot.

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.140
Chariot again.

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:23.860
You really like Shiny Chariot, don't you?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.440
Of course I do.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.530
Chariot is so cute, and cool and shiny!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:31.070
If you witches don't admire her,

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.370
there is something wrong with you.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.790
She's not very reputable
in the wizard world.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:41.120
They're saying she spread around
the wrong image about witches.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.790
She just casts
completely nonsensical spells.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.880
She's more an illusionist than a witch.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.130
She's a fake, a fraud, an act.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.920
Even her outfit is a little scandalous.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.090
And her incantations are seriously lame.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.220
Are you okay?

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.970
If I hit my head one more time,
I'll lose my magic power.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:58.930
You don't have any to begin with.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.310
All right, I am just a primitive witch!

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.150
Leave me alone!

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:05.770
Akko, we're sorry
if we hurt your feelings.

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.280
Sucy and I didn't mean to.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:10.860
Right. She has a right to believe in
whoever she likes.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.570
Even if it's a fraud like Chariot.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.030
Quiet, Sucy.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.820
<i>-Everyone misunderstands Chariot.</i>
-Why must you always say the wrong thing?

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.540
<i>She taught me that wizardry</i>
<i>is a wonderful thing.</i>

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.160
-What? That she's a fraud?
-You can say it more nicely.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.250
<i>How could I make everyone</i>
<i>understand Chariot?</i>

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.790
-I was just kidding.
-Sucy!

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.340
We are performing
our practical training today.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:33.760
This tower is built on
an ancient labyrinth.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.430
The assignment today
is to go down the labyrinth,

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:40.600
find a hidden treasure and retrieve it.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.440
The rarer the treasure will be,

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.440
the higher the points your team will get.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:48.770
Also, there will be wild monsters
in the labyrinth.

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.400
So be careful.

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:52.530
The lower you go,

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.820
-the rarer the treasure.
-Sounds like any other role-playing game.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:57.620
But more monsters will be protecting it.
But we're facing monsters.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.120
Akko?

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.290
This is my chance to show off my power!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:04.580
You have up to three hours.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.380
Use all the magic you've learned so far

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:09.040
and surprise me.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.170
Begin!

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:17.890
Hurry, hurry.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.720
Wait for us.

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.480
Hurry up, or Diana will get ahead of us!

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.980
But it's so dark and dangerous.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.190
Hold on.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:30.190
Come on out.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.740
Now I can see my steps.

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:45.540
You took all the fun out of it.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.380
Take that, monster!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.670
Have a little taste of my magic!

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:56.800
You think you can get away?

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:57.970
Think again!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:09:59.680
Akko!

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.640
The assignment is not
to wipe out the monsters!

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.690
It wasn't even worth my time.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:14.280
Diana, we should start heading back.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:18.110
I agree. You see, we already obtained
some nice treasures.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.120
Mythril Mail and Galvorn knife

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.240
and Sylmaril ring.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.080
They are all common items.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.580
No one considers them to be treasures.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.870
But it's so dangerous here.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.040
We can't go on anymore.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.130
Witches are supposed to be feared.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.340
How could you be afraid of this place?

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:38.680
Besides, my magic is invincible.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:41.090
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:43.390
Diana...

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:45.560
What's wrong?

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:47.520
A cow...

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:49.390
-A cow...
-A Cow?

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.200
Oops!

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.820
Damn it! Where did it go?

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.410
Calm down!

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.830
What? This way!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.080
Akko!

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.710
She's too worked up.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.920
You just wait there.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.290
I'm gonna finish you now.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.220
Akko!

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.180
A minotaur?

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.810
Here's my chance!

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:32.520
All the swords!

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:39.360
Be my blades and strike him down!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.040
Are you all right, Akko?

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.790
This is not good.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.160
It's my turn.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.250
Sucy.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.670
What are you going to do?

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:55.960
Hey, Mr. cow?

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.340
Open your mouth.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:01.590
Enjoy.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.610
-It worked too well, I guess.
-Gross!

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:20.650
Let's leave.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:23.280
-Seems like we can go down from here.
-What?

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.160
You want to keep going on?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.280
Let's stop.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.490
It's too dangerous.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.830
If you're too scared,

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:32.120
why don't you stay here
with those slowpokes?

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.710
What?

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.040
Well then.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.250
-Wait!
-We're coming along!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:39.800
Don't leave us!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:41.380
We're not staying with slowpokes.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.090
We saved them.
What kind of attitude is that?

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.180
Let's go too!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:47.350
How?

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:49.470
How? With a broom.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.640
I didn't bring it.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.720
What?

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.690
Why not?

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.310
You can't even ride it.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.150
Shut up!

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.520
Anyway, we'll go after Diana.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:02.360
-On foot?
-We wouldn't make it back on time.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.570
If we don't, we won't defeat Diana.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:19.170
Are we allowed to come down this far?

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.680
An iron maiden?

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:32.680
A torture chamber which had sucked blood
from hundreds of witches.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:37.480
Trying to keep witches away
with this kind of toy.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.230
There must be something very precious
hiding in it.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:44.110
Let me reveal it!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.750
Is this it?

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.460
It's just a lizard.

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.210
-What?
-You scared me.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.090
You tiny thing!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.050
He's trying to threaten us.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.510
I will punish you!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.850
I guess it wasn't enough!

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:22.610
He's stubborn.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.070
-Play time is over!
-There!

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.910
There you go.
Die already.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:31.910
No.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:33.450
Don't use magic!

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:43.170
Wow. There are mountains of things here.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.300
But it doesn't look
like a treasure storage.

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.920
It's storage for junk.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.760
Really, it's a dumpsite.

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:52.510
We're running out of time.
We need to go soon.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.430
What shall we do?

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:58.180
There isn't much we can do.
Let's pick something from here and go.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.400
Is that... No way!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.780
What now?

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:29.050
A dragon?

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:34.760
Diana?

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.060
What happened down there?

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.640
It's nothing.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:39.890
But you're a mess!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.650
Anyway, where did that thing go?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.360
You mean the dragon?

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.650
He flew away.

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:49.070
Lend me your broom.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:53.950
You ladies stay here.

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:55.620
I will take care of it.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.280
Wait! What's happening?

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:01.210
I accidentally freed him.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.170
So I have to take care of it.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.080
Good day.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:08.210
Why is she always trying to act cool?

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.460
Right.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.170
What is it, Akko?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.800
It was somewhere around here.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:15.430
What are you looking for?

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.520
-Here it is!
-What is it?

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.930
Did you find a treasure?

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.810
I found a terribly precious thing.

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.980
Chariot's Shiny rod!

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:29.730
What?

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.950
What is it?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.660
What's going on?

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:41.910
Oh, my God!

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.920
Here's our chance!
Attack him!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.130
Go!

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:50.670
No! Stop!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.930
You did it.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.600
Emergency escape!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:07.060
Everybody, run out of this building!

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.780
It got bigger again.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.030
Diana.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:15.910
Professor!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.450
We've got a problem.

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.530
The ancient dragon has woken up.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.120
I will stop him here
and I'll lead the students out.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.790
I... I need to tell you...

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:28.130
I wonder who in the world
could have broken the seal.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.050
Stop! Stop!

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.880
This is why I offered to give you a ride.

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:39.350
It's just a lemon from the dump...

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.100
Professor! I got a great treasure!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:44.060
The Shiny rod!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:46.560
A magic staff Shiny Chariot cherished!

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.520
This has to provide me
with the highest score!

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:51.320
Now is not a good time.

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:53.690
Seven stars?

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:57.280
<i>I never thought</i>
<i>it would get the spark back.</i>

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.620
Oh, right.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.500
Okay. Akko, do me a favor.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.500
Take the staff and go to
where the Sorcerer's Stone is.

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.090
Sorcerer's Stone?

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.340
That dragon grows
when it consumes the magic.

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:16.300
Perhaps it will go to
the Sorcerer's Stone for power.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:21.260
While I distract it,
you go ahead and go there.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.970
-Diana, come with me!
-Yes, ma'am!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.850
I'm counting on you.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:29.270
Where is the Sorcerer's Stone?

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.810
At the top of this tower.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:33.320
-We learned that in class.
-Anyway!

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:36.110
I got Chariot with me!

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:37.950
I'm not afraid of anything!

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:40.360
Let's go!

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:46.370
This is not good.
It's getting out.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.040
Lead the students out!

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.210
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.460
I have to distract it somehow!

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:00.090
This way!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:02.930
I'm here! Follow me!

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:08.310
I said I could go by myself.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:12.060
If we rely on you,
we don't know when we'll get there.

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:20.280
I have to lead it as far away as possible.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.070
Wait!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:24.870
You prefer younger girls?

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.200
-Akko!
-What?

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.540
It's coming.

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.460
Hurry, Lotte.

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.840
Professor is of no help.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.380
It already caught up with us.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:37.760
I'll try to stop it.

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.470
Sucy!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:44.010
Take that!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.470
How did you like it?

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:52.560
Sucy!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:02.240
It powered up with Sucy's poison!

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:04.490
If it eats the Sorcerer's Stone...

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:11.790
Ouch!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:19.800
Lotte!

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.380
Are you okay?

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.070
It's responding to the Sorcerer's Stone.

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:46.530
The magic power is pouring into it!

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:48.450
Akko!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.700
-Professor!
-Give me the staff!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:53.660
I... I can't control it.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.210
-Watch out!
-What?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.800
Professor!

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:08.850
No!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:15.850
I can use it?

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:19.690
In that case!

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.080
Staff! Become a broom!

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:34.750
No way!

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.210
Why doesn't it become a broom?

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.630
Go away!

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:07.650
I can't hold on.

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:10.070
<i>Don't forget.</i>

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:12.330
<i>It's your belief in yourself</i>
<i>that makes up your magic.</i>

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:30.590
I believe in myself.

00:22:33.510 --> 00:22:35.310
Macmur. Micmur.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:37.230
Mactoral!

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:40.150
Reveal yourself, bow of light!

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:46.150
Shiny

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:49.070
Arc!

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:13.390
I did it.

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:16.930
But I'm gonna die!

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.020
Diana?

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:24.570
Don't thank me.

00:23:24.650 --> 00:23:27.530
It's my duty to lead the students
to safety.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:34.160
The Sorcerer's Stone.

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:37.870
The magic power released from the dragon
is gathering together.

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:39.210
By the way...

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:42.710
How did you know how to use Shiny Arc?

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:46.380
Because at that moment,
I heard Chariot's voice.

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:47.500
Diana.

00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:49.260
Do you know about Shiny Arc?

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:50.670
Well...

00:23:50.760 --> 00:23:54.010
I heard about it somewhere.

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:55.930
What? You're acting suspiciously.

00:23:56.010 --> 00:23:58.140
Are you a fan of Chariot?

00:23:58.220 --> 00:23:59.600
No way!

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:01.270
Then why are you blushing?

00:24:01.350 --> 00:24:02.890
I'm not!

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:05.020
If you keep talking,
I will let go of you.

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:07.070
No, don't!
